    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "Izlazni kanali", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Doga\u0111aji ostaju unutar aplikacije; ako \u017eelite, po\u0161aljite istu obavest na centar za obave\u0161tenja va\u0161eg telefona ili na Telegram. Nijedno od ovoga nije obavezno.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Unesite ime teme \u2014 nije potrebna prijava", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "Tema", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Obave\u0161tenja se objavljuju na ovoj temi na ntfy.sh; ako samo vi znate ime teme, samo vi ih primate.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "Email", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Upozorenja se \u0161alju na email adresu va\u0161eg naloga", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "\u0160alju se na va\u0161u sopstvenu adresu dok ste prijavljeni; nijedna tajna se ne \u010duva u aplikaciji.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Primalac", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Obave\u0161tenja na vi\u0161e ure\u0111aja", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Upozorenje \u010dlana porodice sti\u017ee u centar za obave\u0161tenja \u010dak i kada je aplikacija zatvorena", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "Ide u centre za obave\u0161tenja drugih \u010dlanova i va\u0161ih drugih ure\u0111aja; primalac mora imati ovaj kanal omogu\u0107en na svom ure\u0111aju.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST na va\u0161 vlastiti server \u2014 napredno", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Prihva\u0107en je samo HTTPS; svaki doga\u0111aj se \u0161alje kao {source, id, title, detail, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
    "Bot anahtar\u0131": "Bot token", // EN: Bot token
    "Sohbet ID": "Chat ID", // EN: Chat ID
    "Bot anahtar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda kal\u0131r": "Bot token ostaje samo na ovom ure\u0111aju", // EN: The bot token stays on this device only
    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Token se nikada ne otprema u oblak; unesite ga ponovo na drugim ure\u0111ajima.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
    "Sistem Bildirimleri": "Sistemska obave\u0161tenja", // EN: System Notifications
    "Taray\u0131c\u0131 ve telefonun uyar\u0131 merkezi": "Centar za obave\u0161tenja va\u0161eg pregleda\u010da i telefona", // EN: Your browser and phone notification centre
    "\u0130zin bekleniyor\u2026": "\u010cekanje na dozvolu\u2026", // EN: Waiting for permission…
    "\u0130zin verildi": "Dozvola odobrena", // EN: Permission granted
    "\u0130zin zaten a\u00e7\u0131k": "Dozvola je ve\u0107 uklju\u010dena", // EN: Permission already on
    "\u0130zin reddedilmi\u015f": "Dozvola odbijena", // EN: Permission denied
    "Bildirim deste\u011fi yok": "Nema podr\u0161ke za obave\u0161tenja", // EN: No notification support
    "De\u011fi\u015fiklikler otomatik kaydedilir.": "Promene se automatski \u010duvaju.", // EN: Changes are saved automatically.
    "Bildirim motoru bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde y\u00fcklenmedi.": "Mehanizam za obave\u0161tenja nije u\u010ditan u ovoj verziji.", // EN: The notification engine didn't load in this build.
    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal": "Otvori kanal", // EN: Open channel
    "Hi\u00e7bir kanal a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil.": "Nijedan kanal nije omogu\u0107en.", // EN: No channel is enabled.
    "G\u00f6nderilen {0}": "{0} poslat", // EN: {0} sent
    "Hatal\u0131 {0}": "{0} neuspe\u0161no", // EN: {0} failed
    "Son hata": "Poslednja gre\u0161ka", // EN: Last error
    "\u015eu an rahats\u0131z etmeyin a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Ne uznemiravaj je trenutno uklju\u010den.", // EN: Do Not Disturb is on right now.
    "\u015eu an sessiz saatler i\u00e7inde.": "Tihi sati su trenutno aktivni.", // EN: Quiet hours are active right now.
    "\u00dcstteki anahtar kapal\u0131": "Prekida\u010d iznad je isklju\u010den", // EN: The switch above is off
    "hi\u00e7bir bildirim g\u00f6nderilmez.": "nema poslata obave\u0161tenja.", // EN: no notification is sent.
    "G\u00f6nderiliyor\u2026": "\u0160alje se\u2026", // EN: Sending…
    "\u0130letildi": "Dostavljeno", // EN: Delivered
    "Baz\u0131 kanallar hata verdi": "Neki kanali nisu uspeli", // EN: Some channels failed
    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal yok": "Nijedan kanal nije omogu\u0107en", // EN: No channel enabled
    "Sessiz saatlerde d\u0131\u015fa d\u00f6n\u00fck kanallar durur; uyar\u0131lar uygulama i\u00e7inde birikmeye devam eder.": "Tokom tihih sati odlazni kanali se pauziraju; obave\u0161tenja se i dalje akumuliraju unutar aplikacije.", // EN: During quiet hours outbound channels pause; alerts keep accumulating inside the app.
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar sessiz saatleri a\u015fs\u0131n": "Dozvoli kriti\u010dnim obave\u0161tenjima da zaobi\u0111u tihi re\u017eim", // EN: Let critical alerts bypass quiet hours
    "G\u00fcvenlik, acil durum ve alarm olaylar\u0131 bu saatlerde de bildirilir.": "Bezbednosni, hitni i alarm doga\u0111aji se i dalje dostavljaju tokom tih sati.", // EN: Security, emergency and alarm events are still delivered during those hours.
    "Ses ve Titre\u015fim": "Zvuk i vibracija", // EN: Sound and Vibration
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar her zaman sesli gelir. Titre\u015fim yaln\u0131zca telefonda ge\u00e7erlidir; Android'de ses ve titre\u015fim ayr\u0131ca telefonun bildirim ayarlar\u0131ndan da de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir.": "Kriti\u010dna obave\u0161tenja uvek zvone. Vibracija va\u017ei samo za telefone; na Android-u, zvuk i vibracija se tako\u0111e mogu promeniti u pode\u0161avanjima sistema za obave\u0161tenja.", // EN: Critical alerts always sound. Vibration applies on phones only; on Android, sound and vibration can also be changed in the system notification settings.
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131nca ba\u015flat": "Pokreni sa ra\u010dunarom", // EN: Start with computer
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS arka planda a\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n.": "Pokreni NEXUS u pozadini kada se ra\u010dunar pokrene.", // EN: Launch NEXUS in the background when your computer starts.
    "Kapat\u0131nca arka planda \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r": "Nastavi da radi u pozadini kad je zatvoren", // EN: Keep running in background when closed
    "Pencere kapat\u0131lsa da otomasyonlar tepside \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya devam etsin.": "Automatizacije nastavljaju da rade u sistemskoj traci kada je prozor zatvoren.", // EN: Automations keep running in system tray when the window is closed.
    "Yenilemek i\u00e7in \u00e7ekin": "Povuci da osve\u017ei\u0161", // EN: Pull to refresh
    "Sens\u00f6rler": "Senzori", // EN: Sensors
    "Hareket, kap\u0131/pencere ve \u00e7evre sens\u00f6rleri": "Senzori pokreta, vrata/prozora i okoline", // EN: Motion, door/window and environmental sensors
