    "G\u00fcndo\u011fumu": "Izlazak sunca", // EN: Sunrise
    "G\u00fcndo\u011fumu tetikleyicisi: ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi.": "Okida\u010d za izlazak sunca: lokacija doma nije postavljena.", // EN: Sunrise trigger: no home location set.
    "A\u011f \u00fczerinden PC veya TV uyand\u0131rma (Home Assistant standard\u0131)": "Uklju\u010di PC ili TV preko mre\u017ee (standard Home Assistant)", // EN: Wake PC or TV over network (Home Assistant standard)
    "Wake-on-LAN PC / TV": "Wake-on-LAN za PC / TV", // EN: Wake-on-LAN PC / TV
