    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "Nakon \u0161to unesete va\u0161e podatke, lako mo\u017eete resetovati lozinku prate\u0107i korake koje vam po\u0161aljemo.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Koristite NEXUS desktop aplikaciju na va\u0161em ra\u010dunaru; isti asistent i kontrole rade i tamo.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "\u0106askajte i sa va\u0161eg ra\u010dunara; va\u0161i razgovori ostaju sinhronizovani na svim ure\u0111ajima.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "Pridru\u017ei se domu", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kada se ure\u0111aj uklju\u010di ili isklju\u010di", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Dodirnite ure\u0111aj da otvorite kontrolni ekran panela; prikazuje samo funkcije koje taj ure\u0111aj podr\u017eava. Za Shelly, WLED i ESPHome ure\u0111aje, uklju\u010divanje/isklju\u010divanje i osvetljenje idu direktno na ure\u0111aj.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ovaj kod se koristi na ekranu Pridru\u017ei se domu.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
