    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Unesite IP adresu ure\u0111aja i NEXUS \u0107e odrediti koji protokol koristi.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Proverite Wi-Fi vezu ure\u0111aja i svoj ruter. Ako problem i dalje postoji, uklonite ure\u0111aj i dodajte ga ponovo. Koraci: Ure\u0111aji > izaberite ure\u0111aj > Ukloni.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Proverite Wi-Fi vezu ure\u0111aja i svoj ruter. Ako problem i dalje postoji, uklonite ure\u0111aj iz NEXUS aplikacije i dodajte ga ponovo.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Ako se va\u0161 ure\u0111aj ne prikazuje, koristite skeniranje QR koda ili kod za pode\u0161avanje. Mo\u017eete otvoriti stranicu sa pomo\u0107i za podr\u0161ku i uputstva.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Usluga lokacije (GPS) na va\u0161em ure\u0111aju je isklju\u010dena. Uklju\u010dite je i poku\u0161ajte ponovo.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Va\u0161 ure\u0111aj ne podr\u017eava usluge lokacije.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
