    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "Isklju\u010di sve grupe svetala koje su uklju\u010dene u domu.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "Kod ku\u0107e i odsutan", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "Odsutan", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Kada ste odsutni", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Upravljajte svetlima u svom domu sobu po sobu u jednom toku. Uklju\u010divanje/isklju\u010divanje, osvetljenje, temperatura boje i pre\u010dice za scene u jednoj aplikaciji.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Daj spremne komande, brze automatizacije i pametne predloge aplikacija na osnovu ure\u0111aja kod ku\u0107e.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Kreiraj aplikaciju za udobnost klime koja upravlja klima ure\u0111ajima i termostatima u tvom domu sa jedne table. Uklju\u010di kontrolu temperature, brze re\u017eime, eko re\u017eim i radnje po sobi.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Koji je status mojih ure\u0111aja?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "Odsutan od ku\u0107e", // EN: Away from Home
    "Evden Uzakta Senaryosu": "Scena Odsutan od ku\u0107e", // EN: Away from Home Scene
    "Evden ayr\u0131l\u0131rken enerji ve g\u00fcvenlik kontrollerini toparlar.": "Obuhvata provere energije i bezbednosti kada napu\u0161ta\u0161 ku\u0107u.", // EN: Wraps up energy and security checks when you leave home.
    "Evden uzakta": "Odsutan od ku\u0107e", // EN: Away from home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Napustanje ku\u0107e", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Provera napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "Scena napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "Rezime napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Zavr\u0161i napu\u0161tanje ku\u0107e", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Kreiraj aplikaciju za proveru napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e koja prikazuje ure\u0111aje koji su uklju\u010deni, status brava i pode\u0161avanja energije na jednom ekranu. Dodaj dugmad za brzo isklju\u010divanje i aktiviranje bezbednosti.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Proveri ure\u0111aje koji su uklju\u010deni, brave i stanje energije u jednom toku kada napu\u0161ta\u0161 ku\u0107u.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Prika\u017ei ure\u0111aje koji su uklju\u010deni, brave i stanje energije na jednom ekranu prilikom napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e. Vidi svetla, uti\u010dnice, klima-ure\u0111aje i sigurnosna pode\u0161avanja koja su uklju\u010dena pre napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e, na jednom panelu. Okupi brze korake isklju\u010divanja i aktiviranja sigurnosti u jedan tok. Hajde da uradimo zavr\u0161ne provere pre nego \u0161to ode\u0161. Automatski isklju\u010di svetla nakon napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e. Automatski isklju\u010di svetla nakon \u0161to ode\u0161 i upali ih kada se vrati\u0161. Automatski isklju\u010di klima-ure\u0111aj kada nema nikoga kod ku\u0107e i izbegni nepotro\u0161nju. Automatski isklju\u010di struju ure\u0111aja u standby re\u017eimu u vreme koje odredi\u0161 no\u0107u. Prilikom napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e. Isklju\u010di uti\u010dnicu prilikom napu\u0161tanja ku\u0107e. Napu\u0161tanje ku\u0107e. Ja sam kod ku\u0107e. Dobrodo\u0161ao ku\u0107i. Kada stigne\u0161 ku\u0107i ili ode\u0161.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
