    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131k kald\u0131k\u00e7a e\u015fle\u015fme ge\u00e7erli kal\u0131r (tepsi/arka plan \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 destekler).": "Bridge mora biti na istoj Wi-Fi mre\u017ei kao va\u0161 iOS ure\u0111aj. Parenje ostaje va\u017ee\u0107e dok va\u0161 ra\u010dunar ostaje aktivan (podr\u017eano je rada u pozadini/tray).", // EN: The bridge has to be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. The pairing stays valid as long as your computer stays awake (tray/background operation supported).
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Ba\u015flat": "Pokreni bridge", // EN: Start the bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcdeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, sonra tekrar dene.": "Pritisnite okruglo dugme na bridge-u, pa poku\u0161ajte ponovo.", // EN: Press the round button on the bridge, then try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Pritisnite okruglo dugme na vrhu bridge-a, zatim dodirnite \u201ePove\u017ei bridge\u201c u roku od 30 sekundi.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "Nije bilo mogu\u0107e povezati se sa bridge-om. Uverite se da ste na istoj mre\u017ei i poku\u0161ajte ponovo.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
