    "NEXUS, \u00e7er\u00e7eve i\u00e7indeki kodu otomatik alg\u0131lar ve e\u015fle\u015fmeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "NEXUS automatski detektuje kod unutar okvira i zapo\u010dinje uparivanje.", // EN: NEXUS detects the code inside the frame automatically and starts pairing.
