    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Na ovoj adresi se nalazi ure\u0111aj, ali ne govori NEXUS protokol.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Ovaj ure\u0111aj je ve\u0107 dodat.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Upari i dodaj", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Kod za uparivanje nije va\u017ee\u0107i. Unesite 11-cifreni kod ili QR sadr\u017eaj koji po\u010dinje sa MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Unesite ovaj kod u NEXUS desktop aplikaciji. Ako je ure\u0111aj povezan na Wi-Fi, mo\u017eete ga dodati i preko lokalne mre\u017ee preko njegove IP adrese.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Ure\u0111aj se tra\u017ei na istoj mre\u017ei i uparuje. Ovo mo\u017ee potrajati do minut; ure\u0111aj mora biti uklju\u010den i u re\u017eimu uparivanja.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ure\u0111aj nije prona\u0111en ili nije mogao da se upari. Uverite se da je na istoj mre\u017ei, uklju\u010den i u re\u017eimu uparivanja.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Ure\u0111aj nije prona\u0111en. Uverite se da je na istoj mre\u017ei, uklju\u010den i u re\u017eimu uparivanja. Firewall va\u0161eg ra\u010dunara mo\u017ee da blokira odgovore sa ure\u0111aja na lokalnoj mre\u017ei.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Ure\u0111aj nije mogao da se upari. Proverite kod za uparivanje i da li je ure\u0111aj u re\u017eimu uparivanja.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Ure\u0111aj je uparen, ali nema funkciju kojom NEXUS mo\u017ee da upravlja.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ure\u0111aj nije odgovorio. Uverite se da je uklju\u010den i na istoj mre\u017ei.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
