    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Prikupite sve provere kod ku\u0107e koje vam trebaju pre spavanja na jednom mestu. Prigu\u0161ite svetla, ne ometaj, provera brave i no\u0107na pode\u0161avanja klime na jednom ekranu.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Kreirajte centar za pripremu za spavanje koji upravlja svetlima, re\u017eimom ti\u0161ine, bravama i klimom pre spavanja. Dodajte zavr\u0161ni pregled i re\u017eim no\u0107i jednim dodirom.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
