    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Postavlja svetla na 85% u neutralnom tonu i isklju\u010duje TV.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Postavlja svetla na 40% u toplom tonu.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Svako ve\u010de u 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Uklju\u010duje klimu na 20\u00b0 i pode\u0161ava termostat na 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Pode\u0161ava termostat na udobnu temperaturu od 24\u00b0.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
