    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Gasi svetla i TV; ostavlja uti\u010dnice i klimu kako jesu.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
