    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Pripremite svetla, zavese i klimu za dan jednim dodirom.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Uklju\u010dite svetla, zavesa i klimu zajedno kada do\u0111ete ku\u0107i.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Stavite svoje ure\u0111aje u bezbedan re\u017eim \u0161tednje energije dok ste dugo odsutni.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Umutite svetla, zatvorite zavese i uklju\u010dite TV.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Pokrenite svoj robotski usisiva\u010d ili ga po\u0161aljite nazad na dok.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Zaklju\u010dajte vrata, zatvorite zavese i pripremite ku\u0107u za no\u0107.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Pogledajte status i pode\u0161avanja privatnosti va\u0161ih kamera na jednom ekranu.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Uklju\u010dite ili isklju\u010dite re\u017eim privatnosti za va\u0161e kamere sa jednog mesta dok ste kod ku\u0107e.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Pogledajte koja automatizacija se pokre\u0107e danas.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Delite bele\u0161ke i obaveze sa \u010dlanovima doma\u0107instva.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Pogledajte pregled zdravstvenog stanja va\u0161e ku\u0107e na osnovu vazduha, vlage i temperature koje va\u0161i senzori mere.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131n yerel a\u011fdan ula\u015f\u0131labilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Proverite da li se va\u0161i ure\u0111aji mogu pristupiti preko lokalne mre\u017ee.", // EN: Check whether your devices can be reached over your local network.
