    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Intervali bez merenja se ne ra\u010dunaju, pa vrednosti mogu biti ni\u017ee od stvarne potro\u0161nje.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
