    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "Naslov i kratak tekst doga\u0111aja vezanih za sigurnost/vanredno stanje na ovom ure\u0111aju pojavljuju se u aplikacijama drugih \u010dlanova ovog doma. Detalji ure\u0111aja i klju\u010devi nikada se ne dele; svaki \u010dlan prati svoja pode\u0161avanja obave\u0161tenja.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
