    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Unesite kod iz pozivnog emaila. Kod se koristi samo jednom i va\u017ei samo za email adresu koja je pozvana.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "Potrebna prijava", // EN: Sign-in required
    "\u00dcye davet etmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce oturum a\u00e7; evin hesab\u0131na otomatik ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Prijavite se prvo da biste pozvali \u010dlanove; bi\u0107ete automatski povezani na nalog va\u0161eg doma.", // EN: Sign in first to invite members; you'll be connected to your home's account automatically.
    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "E-po\u0161ta nije mogla biti poslata sa servera", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "Pozivnica je kreirana, ali automatska e-po\u0161ta nije mogla biti poslata. Da li da pripremimo tekst pozivnice pomo\u0107u va\u0161e mail aplikacije?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
