    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nije bilo mogu\u0107e povezati se sa ure\u0111ajem. Proverite da li je na istoj mre\u017ei.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nije bilo mogu\u0107e povezati se sa ure\u0111ajem. Proverite da li je na istoj mre\u017ei i da li su IP adresa i lokalni klju\u010d ta\u010dni.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Uklju\u010duje svetla u toploj nijansi, otvara zavese i pode\u0161ava klima ure\u0111aj na 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Uklju\u010duje svetla i otvara zavese, pokre\u0107e klima ure\u0111aj na 22\u00b0 i \u0161alje usisiva\u010d da se vrati na punjenje.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Isklju\u010duje svetla, TV i klima ure\u0111aj, zatvara zavese i zaklju\u010dava vrata.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Gasi svetla i TV, zatvara zavese i zaklju\u010dava vrata.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Pode\u0161ava svetla na toplu nijansu na 15%, zatvara zavese i pali TV.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "Zaklju\u010dava vrata i zatvara zavese.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Pali svetla na 70% osvetljenosti.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Pokre\u0107e robotski usisiva\u010d.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
