    "Klimay\u0131 ve termostat\u0131 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir, hava temizleyiciyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Pode\u0161ava klima ure\u0111aj i termostat na komforno pode\u0161avanje i pokre\u0107e pro\u010di\u0161\u0107iva\u010d vazduha.", // EN: Sets the AC and thermostat to the comfort setting and runs the air purifier.
    "Bildirim g\u00f6nderir": "\u0160alje obave\u0161tenje", // EN: Sends a notification
    "Bu senaryo mevcut cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 etkilemiyor. Senaryonun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun bir cihaz (\u00f6r. \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, s\u00fcp\u00fcrge) eklemelisin.": "Ovaj scenario ne uti\u010de na nijedan od va\u0161ih trenutnih ure\u0111aja. Da bi funkcionisao, dodajte odgovaraju\u0107i ure\u0111aj (npr. svetlo, zavesu ili usisiva\u010d).", // EN: This scenario doesn't affect any of your current devices. To make it work, add a suitable device (e.g. a light, curtain or vacuum).
    "Yeni bir ev olu\u015ftur ya da sana g\u00f6nderilen davet koduyla bir eve kat\u0131l.": "Kreirajte novi dom ili se pridru\u017eite domu uz kod za pozivnicu koji vam je poslat.", // EN: Create a new home, or join one with the invite code sent to you.
    "Oturum a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil. Evler yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur. \u00dcye davet etmek, bir eve kat\u0131lmak ve aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7.": "Niste prijavljeni. Domovi se \u010duvaju samo na ovom ure\u0111aju. Prijavite se da biste pozivali \u010dlanove, pridru\u017eili se domu i koristili poruke za porodicu.", // EN: You're not signed in. Homes are kept on this device only. Sign in to invite members, join a home and use the family chat.
